  "story": {
    "title": "CELEBRATION OF MY BIRTHDAY",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "Rahul is celebrating his birthday and has invited his friends. The cake looks very yummy and beautiful.",
      "Rahul is so worried. Cake is so small. How much share each will get? So he asked his mother for help. Mother divide the cake the cake into six equal parts.",
      "Rahul distributed two candies to each of his friend as return gift !!!!",
      "So each child got th of cake. Everyone enjoy the party very much. Wow! So Yummy!!"
    ],
